MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- src/app/recorder/live-copilot.ts: event-driven engine with a hard 5s floor —
  refreshes only when enough NEW transcript landed AND the cadence interval
  passed; never fires on silence/pause. Short rolling window (1400 chars) per
  call, max_tokens 320, temperature 0.2 via 'deepseek-chat' (fast tier).
  Opt-in, OFF by default (localStorage). Tier-gated: Max 7s/140ch,
  Agent Pro 15s/300ch, Student/free excluded (dev bypass tests as Max).
  Prompt instructs the model to silently correct machine-transcription
  mishears from context — audio never leaves the device. Tolerant JSON parse.
- llmComplete() in nemesis-account.ts: first chat-completions caller against
  the nemesis-llm metered proxy (device-key auth, mints on demand, atom sync).
- Recorder UI: Live copilot card between transcript and Mentioned — on/off
  toggle, appending notes, 'Ask next' suggestions, thinking/error status,
  'Suggest now' on-demand button; plan-gate message for excluded tiers.
- On stop, copilot notes fold into the saved lecture note as
  '## Copilot notes (live)' (service.ts persist()).
- Tests: live-copilot.test.ts 16 cases (cadence gate incl. 5s floor, plan
  access, JSON extraction/caps/garbage, prompt contents) — 21/21 green with
  autoname + account-gate suites; tsc/vite build clean.
- ALSO INCLUDES pre-existing uncommitted Codex WIP in nemesis-account.ts
  (trial timing helpers: getTrialTiming/trialCountdownLabel/
  ACCOUNT_BYPASS_ENABLED) — required by the earlier account-gate commit;
  committing it here makes that commit self-consistent.
